  "question": {
    "text": "Match the nuclear processes given in column I with the appropriate option(s) in column II.<table border=\"1\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>Column I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>Column II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A.</td>\t\t\t<td>Nuclear fusion</td>\t\t\t<td>P</td>\t\t\t<td>Absorption of thermal neutrons by <math><mmultiscripts><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mn>92</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>235</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B.</td>\t\t\t<td>Fission in a nuclear reactor</td>\t\t\t<td>Q</td>\t\t\t<td><math><mmultiscripts><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mn>27</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></math> nucleus</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C.</td>\t\t\t<td><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></math> -decay</td>\t\t\t<td>R</td>\t\t\t<td>Energy production in stars via hydrogen conversion to helium</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D.</td>\t\t\t<td><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi></math> -ray emission</td>\t\t\t<td>S</td>\t\t\t<td>Heavy water</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>Neutrino emission</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>",
